.SH OPTIONS
\f[B]\-\-batch\f[R]
.RS
.PP
Specify a batch of commands to execute.
.TP
Example:
\f[B]hyprctl\f[R] \f[I]\-\-batch \(aqeval hl.config({
[\(dqgeneral.border_size\(dq] = 2 }) ; repl
hl.get_active_window().title\(dq\f[R]
.RS
.PP
\f[I];\f[R] separates the commands.
.RE
.RE
